{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Demo Available </strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Wielding makes all the difference</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bubble Gun, you can hold and shoot two weapons at the same time. Since weapons spawn randomly, you want to find and use the best weapon combination in a split second to attack or defend yourself depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.poster.avif?t=1770669228\" width=480 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.webm?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.mp4?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mixing the right weapons at the right time</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon can mix with any element. When holding two weapons, you have three possible attacks: fire either weapon, or fire both at once. You can also use environmental elements to mix with your weapons. <br><br>Just a few examples:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soak opponents to slow them down, then mix fire and water to engulf them in deadly steam.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair a gun with a leaf blower for a sniper shot across the map out of reach from a normal gun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze a waterfall to make a protection from bullets and missile, to give you time to pickup a gun, then shoot a freezing bullet that will slide along the floor for a kill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s all about mixing the right weapons at the right moment to survive and outplay your opponent with whatever weapons and elements you have accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements also affect player bubbles in different ways. An overheated bubble will float upwards uncontrollably, while a frozen bubble shatters on impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elements:</strong> Fire, Water, Freeze, Wind, Slime\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong>: Gun, Shotgun, Bow, Rocket Launcher, Bomb, Flame Thrower, Water Gun, Snow Thrower, Leaf Blower, Slime Gun</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/1287122cfe4566e4424ae870de9258fc.poster.avif?t=1770669228\" width=640 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/1287122cfe4566e4424ae870de9258fc.webm?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/1287122cfe4566e4424ae870de9258fc.mp4?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVP</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Brawler mode</strong>, Bubble Gun is a <strong>last-bubble-standing</strong> arena fighter where positioning, timing, and weapon mixing matter more than raw aim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons and elements spawn dynamically in the arena. You rarely get the \u201cperfect\u201d loadout \u2014 winning means <strong>adapting instantly</strong> to what you pick up and what your opponents are using.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>PVE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Survival mode</strong>, Bubble Gun is a <strong>solo or co-operative endurance challenge</strong>. You can face the waves alone or team up with other players to survive increasingly intense enemy attacks.<br><br>Survival is not about perfect execution \u2014 it\u2019s about understanding enemy strengths and weaknesses and finding the most effective weapon and element combinations to counter them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run starts with <strong>three random weapons</strong>, and every <strong>three waves</strong> you are offered a new weapon choice. You must work with the tools you are given, adapting your strategy as enemy types and wave pressure evolve, whether playing solo or coordinating with a team.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize your Bubble</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bubble customization is not just cosmetic \u2014 it\u2019s designed for <strong>readability in chaos</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can customize your bubble\u2019s <strong>color, hats, masks, glasses, and costumes</strong>, allowing players to quickly recognize themselves and others during fast-paced battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clear silhouettes and strong visual contrast make it easier to track movement, identify opponents, and react instantly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/7d798f32bc46560f98d9603c9631ae3a.avif?t=1770669228\" width=1324 height=531 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Supported with <u> Remote Play Together</u>\u00a0(shift+tab in game)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3859320?t=1770669228","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/5a09a7e72168cf10ddda80b0fd249bbc6f10c8ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770669228","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/94768f5d64b5b29570a884344fb525771547798a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770669228","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/94768f5d64b5b29570a884344fb525771547798a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770669228","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3920750,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Demo Available </strong></u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dual Wielding makes all the difference</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bubble Gun, you can hold and shoot two weapons at the same time. Since weapons spawn randomly, you want to find and use the best weapon combination in a split second to attack or defend yourself depending on the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.poster.avif?t=1770669228\" width=480 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.webm?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/adffaa87752a9c98a749411cdaa7fe39.mp4?t=1770669228\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mi