silhouettes and strong visual contrast make it easier to track movement, identify opponents, and react instantly.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/extras/7d798f32bc46560f98d9603c9631ae3a.avif?t=1770669228\" width=1324 height=531 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Multiplayer Supported with <u> Remote Play Together</u>\u00a0(shift+tab in game)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Emergence Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3859320/813f2bebb2aa4379e3a827dd9d8147e1600af411/header.jpg?t=1770669228","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Digital Emergence Ltd. All rights reserved.<br />\r\nBubble Gun\u2122 is a trademark of Digital Emergence Ltd.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Zen\u202f2<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD RDNA\u202f2 GPU<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS 12 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon or Intel<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> AMD Radeon Pro 5500M or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3859320/1694895232/4f7f5cfc5f700a509eeb8b80384e1454d3382a91/1769036903/dash_av1.mpd?t=1769039775","dash_h2